WEBVTT

00:10:58.396 --> 00:11:00.206
Na bakteria wako wanapanga nini?

00:11:00.958 --> 00:11:02.745
Bakteria wanaongea,

00:11:02.769 --> 00:11:04.795
wanatengeneza mipango ya siri,

00:11:04.819 --> 00:11:07.642
na wanatumiana taarifa za siri.


00:11:08.253 --> 00:11:10.932
Lakini sio tu kuawaangalia wenyewe
wakinong'onezana,

00:11:10.956 --> 00:11:13.423
sisi sote tunaweza kujifunza lugha ya siri

00:11:13.447 --> 00:11:16.326
na kua wenyewe wanong'onezi wa bakteria.

00:11:16.973 --> 00:11:18.687
Na, kama bakteria wangesema,

00:11:19.656 --> 00:11:22.754
"3-oxo-C12-aniline."

00:11:23.763 --> 00:11:24.931
(Kicheko)

00:11:24.955 --> 00:11:26.040
(Makofi)

00:11:26.064 --> 00:11:27.248
Asanteni.